Correction: this commit does not look for fixed sleeps or step counts in helpers. It finds helper functions that wait as long as a Duration parameter says and fail the test when it runs out (poll_until/recv_timeout/wait_timeout/wait plus assert/panic/expect/unwrap), and flags each call that gives such a helper less than HANG_FLOOR_MS, as a matched wait with a failing timeout already was (review 2026-11-04 P3 tests).
